To use a sink: just quaff from it, just like a potion or a fountain(if you 
drink from it long enough, the sink will wind up as a fountain) It's amazing 
what you find in sinks. ;-)

To use an Altar: use them to offer corpses(fresh PREFERRED! <smile>) to your
patron god. Sometimes your god(dess) will reward you with certain weapons. ;)


